  "id": "chicken-parmesan-pasta-casserole",
  "name": "Chicken Parmesan Pasta Casserole",
  "subtitle": "Crisp chicken, rotini, and marinara baked under melted cheese",
  "description": "Breaded chicken and rotini are layered with wine-enhanced marinara, mozzarella, and Parmesan for a hearty baked dinner.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "yield": {
